@FastFashionCatalogSync.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5240

### Preview the latest approved merchandising version
GET {{FastFashionCatalogSync.Api_HostAddress}}/api/product-rollouts/preview/latest
Accept: application/json

### Schedule a product rollout after copying the fingerprint from the preview response
POST {{FastFashionCatalogSync.Api_HostAddress}}/api/product-rollouts/schedule
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchandisingVersionId": "SS26-DROP-02",
  "scheduledFor": "2026-05-07T23:00:00Z",
  "requestedBy": "merchandising-admin@retail.com",
  "previewFingerprint": "replace-with-preview-fingerprint"
}

### Inspect rollout ledger
GET {{FastFashionCatalogSync.Api_HostAddress}}/api/product-rollouts
Accept: application/json

### Execute due product rollouts
POST {{FastFashionCatalogSync.Api_HostAddress}}/api/product-rollouts/execute-due
Accept: application/json
